GeneralElements -- combines generators of same degree into a general linear combination
***************************************************************************************

Description
===========

If GeneralElements is set to true, *note idealSheafGens: idealSheafGens, will
replace all generators of I of the same degree with a new generator of the that
degree which is a general linear combination of those generators, then run
idealSheafGens on the new ideal.

See also
========

  * *note idealSheafGens: idealSheafGens, -- creates a list of subsets of the
    minimal generators that generate a given ideal up to saturation

