virtualOfPair(...,LengthLimit=>...) -- stop when the virtual resolution reaches this length
*******************************************************************************************

Description
===========

When the optional argument LengthLimit is specified virtualOfPair will stop
computing syzygies after the given length is reached, otherwise computation
continues until the resolution terminates.

See also
========

  * *note virtualOfPair: virtualOfPair, -- creates a virtual resolution from a
    free resolution by keeping only summands of specified degrees

